<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>C on Chocolate's 废纸篓</title><link>https://hex.moe/tags/c/</link><description>Recent content in C on Chocolate's 废纸篓</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 17 Sep 2019 16:26:17 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://hex.moe/tags/c/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>cpp学习笔记(scanf与getline)</title><link>https://hex.moe/p/cpp2019/</link><pubDate>Tue, 17 Sep 2019 16:26:17 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hex.moe/p/cpp2019/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>蒟蒻萌新的 C 与 C++学习笔记.&lt;/p>
&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>任何一个伟大的目标,都有一个微不足道的开始.&lt;/strong> —— 洛谷&lt;/p>
&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>最近在学习一些 OI 的知识，其实以前是学过 C++的但是, &lt;del>Python 实在是太香了&lt;/del>
由于太久没用过全部白给了，但是由于了解到比赛 C++可以用 STL &lt;del>真香&lt;/del>
所以开了一个从 C 转换到 C++的一些笔记. &lt;del>天坑&lt;/del> &amp;gt; &lt;del>什么时候支持 C++11&lt;/del>&lt;/p>
&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;h2 id="从-scanf-到-cin-到-getline">从 scanf 到 cin 到 getline
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>之前习惯使用 scanf 来某些格式化的输入 如
&lt;a class="link" href="https://vjudge.net/problem/HDU-2005" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>https://vjudge.net/problem/HDU-2005&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>可以通过&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-c" data-lang="c">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nf">scanf&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;%d/%d/%d&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">year&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">month&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">day&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>分割输入&lt;/p>
&lt;p>转换到 C++时 当然是要使用 STL 辣&lt;/p>
&lt;p>但是似乎没有类似&lt;/p>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>cin&amp;raquo;year&amp;raquo;month&amp;raquo;day&lt;/p>
&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>的操作,后面找到了一个代替方案&lt;/p>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>std::getline()&lt;/p>
&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>getline 有四个重载 其中&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">10
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">11
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-cpp" data-lang="cpp">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">template&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;lt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="k">class&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nc">_Elem&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">class&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nc">_Traits&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">class&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nc">_Alloc&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kr">inline&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">basic_istream&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;lt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">_Elem&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">_Traits&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">getline&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">basic_istream&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;lt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">_Elem&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">_Traits&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">_Istr&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">basic_string&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;lt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">_Elem&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">_Traits&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">_Alloc&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">_Str&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">const&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">_Elem&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">_Delim&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c1">// get characters into string, discard delimiter
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">getline&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">_STD&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">move&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">_Istr&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">),&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">_Str&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">_Delim&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>这个方法可以设置结束符号&lt;/p>
&lt;p>还是与HDU-2005为例子&lt;/p>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>1985/1/20&lt;/p>
&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">8
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-cpp" data-lang="cpp">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">std&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">::&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">string&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">year&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">std&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">::&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">string&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">month&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">std&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">::&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">string&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">day&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">while&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">std&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">::&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">getline&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">std&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">::&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">cin&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">year&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="sc">&amp;#39;/&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">))&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">std&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">::&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">getline&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">std&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">::&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">cin&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">month&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="sc">&amp;#39;/&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">std&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">::&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">getline&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">std&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">::&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">cin&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">day&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="sc">&amp;#39;/&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>这样就可以获取到三个值了&lt;/p>
&lt;p>总感觉有点怪怪的,应该有更好的方法我不知道吧,各位dalao评论区请&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>